  70+ 7E21
  71+ 7E21                  ; Slot attivo
  72+ 7E21 DD 36 00 80      ld   (ix+0), $80               ; Active = 1, Horizontal (Bit 6 = 0)
  73+ 7E25 CB 7F            bit  7, a
